  "description": "Zero-reflection, Native AOT and trimming safe validation for .NET. Decorate properties with attributes (email, region-aware phone/postal code, date, URL, credit card, password strength, IP address, range, length, regex, cross-property equality, nested object/collection validation) and a Roslyn source generator emits a compile-time Validate() extension method for you — no reflection at runtime.",
  "id": "FastValidate",
