  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added DateValidation, RegexValidation (compile-time inline pattern), EqualsValidation (cross-property, e.g. confirm password, with FV002 diagnostic), ValidateObject and ValidateCollection (nested/recursive validation with prefixed property names). Added a BenchmarkDotNet comparison against reflection-based validation (~3.5x faster, ~5x less allocation).",
